      "writtenOn": "2025-08-28T07:54:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sent the diff files by e-mail. It looks like there are diffs in res_index.txt, so you might be right. There are other differences, I haven\u0027t looked into them yet.\n\nI updated this CL to apply the same change to region, zone, and units. The file size of `common` match with when removed, but the file size of `android` is still bigger than when removed by 30kb, so probably there are more to filter out. I\u0027ll look into the diff later tonight.\n\nIt still worries me a bit that maintaining 4 trees (locale, region, zone, units) in 8 filters (desktop, cros, android, cast, castvideo, fultter, flutter_desktop, ios) could be error prone, compared to removing + patching to update the res_index (I don\u0027t know how yet though) because the latter guarantees to apply on all platforms.",
