      "message": "The list of locales is obtained via a glob on the txt file directory:\n\nhttps://github.com/unicode-org/icu/blob/39111ab37a289713314c2cf1867221c28ed269b7/icu4c/source/data/BUILDRULES.py#L565\n\nAnd res_index.txt is generated based on the results of filtering the glob output with the filters:\n\nhttps://github.com/unicode-org/icu/blob/39111ab37a289713314c2cf1867221c28ed269b7/icu4c/source/python/icutools/databuilder/request_types.py#L337\n\nSo your hypothesis seems correct.\n\n---\n\nHowever, the locale filter is supposed to apply to all trees. I don\u0027t immediately know why you need to repeat it for each component tree.",
